# Every key nuc has printed, '<rule ID>:<reason>', read by tests/contract.rs
# (API-command-line-with-sense), every key a shim writes (API-hook-contract-keyed-shims), and
# every key a refusal of nuc.toml ends in (API-config-refusals-keyed). A key stays once listed: a
# reader or a test branches on it in place of a message's wording, so no reason is renamed,
# dropped, or given to another cause. Also every key `nuc sense` ends a refusal in
# (API-git-only-sensors-under-sense).

